Revision history for Gears

0.105 - 2026-11-11
	- added effective_charset, charset_encode, charset_decode to Gears
	- added Gears::Role::HasContext
	- Gears::Context app attribute is now optional
	- fixed bad check and docs on Gears::X::HTTP status range
	- fixed unintended +-= regex range in Gears::Config prefix checking
	- fixed not emptying config arrays using - prefix with all array elements
	- fixed unintended addition of caret in safe characters when building a sigil location
	- Gears::Generator no longer leaves created empty directories behind when aborting
	- fixed incorrect handling of regex alternation in checks when building a sigil location
	- pattern_separator Router attribute can now only be a single character
	- fixed Match router bridge behavior - requires followup of separator or end of string
	- fixed SigilMatch router separator behavior - uses pattern_separator when matching and building

0.104 - 2026-05-26
	- Add pattern_separator attribute to Router

0.103 - 2026-05-26
	- Bump Mooish::Base dependency

0.102 - 2026-05-25
	- Fix package Gears::X::Logger (bad namespace name)

0.101 - 2026-01-14
	- Fix failing generator tests

0.100 - 2026-01-12
	- Start of the beta phase

0.001 - 2026-01-03
	- First version

